+## Dependencies
+
+- The setup task establishes or reconciles the assumed paths before the remaining tasks.
+- The three integration tests are independent and may run in parallel; all must be failing before core implementation.
+- The migration enables durable deduplication for the service; the signature helper enables the authenticated callback route; the service and route enable the duplicate-delivery test.
+- The delivery-status query follows the migration and makes the cross-workspace test pass. Polish and local validation follow the core tasks.
